{"parse": {"title": "CO-20", "pageid": 100929, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/CO-19\" title=\"CO-19\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">CO-20</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">CO</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">20</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.AE.87.E5.AE.99.E6.97.A0.E4.BA.8B.E5.8F.91.E7.94.9F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"宇宙无事发生\">宇宙无事发生</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 宇宙无事发生</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">As If Nothing Happened Up There</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>而<span class=\"color-value\"></span>我<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>永<span class=\"color-value\"></span>远<span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>路<span class=\"color-value\"></span>上<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2710120</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-senlinguangchang1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"senlinguangchang1\"><img alt=\"senlinguangchang1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/Cg-senlinguangchang1.png/600px-Cg-senlinguangchang1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/Cg-senlinguangchang1.png/900px-Cg-senlinguangchang1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/Cg-senlinguangchang1.png/1200px-Cg-senlinguangchang1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>白色石墙将世界分隔成里侧与外侧，同时也带来了长久的寂静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>逐渐靠近的脚步声与说话声令这份寂静骤然消散。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅰ：</div><div>拉普拉斯说要研究的那东西怎么样了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>你说传送软盘吗？上次会议里提到过，它很快就会登上外勤物资申请单。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>如果它能彻底普及开，让我每天下班直接传送回宿舍，我愿意称它是最伟大的发明。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅰ：</div><div>算了吧，万一反过来缩短我们的集合时间呢？真这样方便，你不就得随叫随到了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>天哪，你说得对！我受不了了，拉普拉斯那群工作狂——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅰ：</div><div>起码他们真搞到了“暴雨”相关的数据，这可是件大活儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅰ：</div><div>全宇宙都会被回溯，还挺公平嘛……至少不是只有地球倒霉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>哈，兄弟，我就欣赏你这份乐观。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>为什么那个航天小队不是公开招募？谁不想去宇宙里瞧瞧呢？换成我，我恨不得在宿舍门口拉上横幅，到时候还要把这事迹刻在墓碑上！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅰ：</div><div>万一有下次机会呢？说起来，拉普拉斯的人我不熟，但我认识他们队里基金会的小子。可惜命名日好像又去跑外勤了，到时候可以约他喝酒，打探点新鲜消息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅰ：</div><div>他还是航天小队的成员，意味着他要打两份工，哇哦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>你怎么认识那么多工作狂？我要重新审视你了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>但日子确实好起来了。我们会解决“暴雨”，我相信这不过是眨眼的事……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅰ：</div><div>嘘……阿尔文，你听到没有？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>你说啥……哦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这里不常有琴声。忙碌的职员们最近才重新拾起一些过去的爱好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是一支相当有名的曲子，它曾与另外二十六支歌曲共同穿越茫茫群星，至今也仍在途中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">远旅：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>当陈旧的岁月淹没了这一代人，<br />你仍将栖息在人群之中，为人的朋友。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_bg_kuangkeng2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_bg_kuangkeng2\"><img alt=\"2_7_bg_kuangkeng2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/Cg-2_7_bg_kuangkeng2.png/600px-Cg-2_7_bg_kuangkeng2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/Cg-2_7_bg_kuangkeng2.png/900px-Cg-2_7_bg_kuangkeng2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/Cg-2_7_bg_kuangkeng2.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_bg_kuangkeng2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我知道这支曲子，指针经常在办公室播那盘录音带。她说是金唱片母带的翻录。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>就是旅行者一号带着的那张。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>1987年它在哪儿呢？已经到太阳系边缘了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>它的动力要到2025年才耗尽，我说的是没有发生“暴雨”的那个2025。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>耗尽动力会怎么样？它会停下？或者损坏？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>没那么严重，只是我们不会再得知它的下落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>它会一直在宇宙中前行，继续它的旅程。如果真有外星文明，也许会在什么时候发现它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>可能那时候地球已经不复存在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>等得太久了，花了太多时间和资源，又无法得到回应。听上去比我们这群人的神秘术还要没用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在注视头顶闪烁的光点时，人们很难想象自己脚下的星球也不过是宇宙中的一个小点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>你会遇上另一些哀愁，并对人说起<br />真实的美丽。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_at_canguanhuitan5_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_at_canguanhuitan5_zone\"><img alt=\"2_7_at_canguanhuitan5_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/Cg-2_7_at_canguanhuitan5_zone.png/600px-Cg-2_7_at_canguanhuitan5_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"251\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/Cg-2_7_at_canguanhuitan5_zone.png/900px-Cg-2_7_at_canguanhuitan5_zone.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/Cg-2_7_at_canguanhuitan5_zone.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_at_canguanhuitan5_zone.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2180\" data-file-height=\"912\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div>这本就是一封并不期待回应的信件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>啊，我想是的。我觉得它只是一个招呼，一句问候。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一种象征。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>“嗨，你们好。这里是地球，这里有过文明。我们尝试活着，或许会成功地战胜时间。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>或许等不到结果，但我个人相信会有谁听见这句问候。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>库珀花环小姐说不定能带回答案。如果你在宇宙里见到了上帝，帮我问问他最喜欢什么音乐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我想这该算是付费服务，请考虑把你的骨碟收藏分给我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div>总之我们要先抵达九九年之后的世界，才有机会搞清楚金唱片的下落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>远旅认真地听着每一句话，有些她能理解，有些她还无法完全弄清。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但她也有想要与朋友们分享的东西。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_at_dahezhao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_at_dahezhao\"><img alt=\"2_7_at_dahezhao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/Cg-2_7_at_dahezhao.png/600px-Cg-2_7_at_dahezhao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/Cg-2_7_at_dahezhao.png/900px-Cg-2_7_at_dahezhao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/Cg-2_7_at_dahezhao.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_at_dahezhao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是为小队的友人们奏响的曲调，是为勇敢的小宇航员送去的祝福与鼓励。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>是来自64亿光年外的回答。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>信件送达了。收件人是一颗会唱歌的星星。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这就是全部。<br />你们在尘世所知晓，且应知晓的事物。<br /><br />                                               <span style=\"font-size:94%\">——济慈 《希腊古瓮颂》</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_bg_fasheshi1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_bg_fasheshi1\"><img alt=\"2_7_bg_fasheshi1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-2_7_bg_fasheshi1.png/600px-Cg-2_7_bg_fasheshi1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-2_7_bg_fasheshi1.png/900px-Cg-2_7_bg_fasheshi1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-2_7_bg_fasheshi1.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_bg_fasheshi1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">众人：</div><div>三。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">众人：</div><div>二。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">众人：</div><div>一。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_bg_fasheshi2_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_bg_fasheshi2_zone\"><img alt=\"2_7_bg_fasheshi2_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b7/Cg-2_7_bg_fasheshi2_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"557\" class=\"story-bg\" data-file-width=\"112\" data-file-height=\"104\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_at_jinchangpian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_at_jinchangpian\"><img alt=\"2_7_at_jinchangpian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/Cg-2_7_at_jinchangpian.png/600px-Cg-2_7_at_jinchangpian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/Cg-2_7_at_jinchangpian.png/900px-Cg-2_7_at_jinchangpian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/Cg-2_7_at_jinchangpian.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_at_jinchangpian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的种族并不具备地球生物理解中的“听觉”。但她有自己的方式理解其上承载的信息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那是她从未想象过，从未感受过的……旋律。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它来自那个黯淡的蓝色光点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>地球。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:277%\">Невероятно.</span><br /><span style=\"font-size:111%\">不可思议的。</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_at_liuxing1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_at_liuxing1\"><img alt=\"2_7_at_liuxing1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Cg-2_7_at_liuxing1.png/600px-Cg-2_7_at_liuxing1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Cg-2_7_at_liuxing1.png/900px-Cg-2_7_at_liuxing1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Cg-2_7_at_liuxing1.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_at_liuxing1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:277%\">Вечный.</span><br /><span style=\"font-size:111%\">永恒的。</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_at_liuxing3_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_at_liuxing3_zone\"><img alt=\"2_7_at_liuxing3_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/c9/Cg-2_7_at_liuxing3_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"1011\" class=\"story-bg\" data-file-width=\"420\" data-file-height=\"708\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:277%\">Красивая.</span><br /><span style=\"font-size:111%\">美丽的。</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_at_yuanlv.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_at_yuanlv\"><img alt=\"2_7_at_yuanlv\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-2_7_at_yuanlv.png/600px-Cg-2_7_at_yuanlv.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-2_7_at_yuanlv.png/900px-Cg-2_7_at_yuanlv.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-2_7_at_yuanlv.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_at_yuanlv.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-senlinguangchang1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"senlinguangchang1\"><img alt=\"senlinguangchang1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/Cg-senlinguangchang1.png/600px-Cg-senlinguangchang1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/Cg-senlinguangchang1.png/900px-Cg-senlinguangchang1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/Cg-senlinguangchang1.png/1200px-Cg-senlinguangchang1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅰ：</div><div>这首歌还挺好听。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>那就多听一会儿——等等，你要去哪儿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅰ：</div><div>我们走吧，别打扰其他人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅰ：</div><div>手上还有活儿要干呢，你之前说的传送软盘领用申请，要怎么提交来着？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>具体事项还不清楚，过几天指针女士应该会进行相关内容的宣讲……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅰ：</div><div>冷周六小姐这么忙吗？怪不得那天的庆祝会她只派几条蛇露了个面。北方哨歌女士和维拉女士倒是留到了最后，噢，还有被那群孩子包围的库珀花环小姐……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅰ：</div><div>芝诺的家伙听见有酒喝就肯定到场，那位年轻飞行员和一条蝾螈划拳拼酒……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅰ：</div><div>后来乌尔里希先生也过去看，再后来我听到命名日在劝兔毛手袋别站在桌上发表总统就任演讲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅰ：</div><div>虽然最后合影时那上头挤满了人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅱ：</div><div>我错过得太多了！不是说路德维希先生很关注职员的心理状态，鼓励他们放松吗？下次活动到底在什么时候——一定还有下次吧？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>脚步声与话语声逐渐远去，琴声也随之止息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>星星用好奇的闪烁打量着这片土地。遥远的蓝色星球。京兆分之一的奇迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她得到了金色的、珍贵的声音，于是也在这儿留下自己的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">远旅：</div><div>*一段轻快的哼唱*</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她学会的第一首歌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>为那些在普列谢茨克的日子，为今后的岁月，为她所认识与铭记的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>为文明的遥远回声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-304801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-304801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-304801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">远旅：</div><div>请……听。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在这颗星球上，她目睹了前所未见的景象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">朋友。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">勇敢的访客。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>四季的更替，海岸线的蜿蜒，温暖或寒冷，和平或纷争。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贫穷与富裕，卑劣与高尚。文明的衰落与崛起，雨燕划过天空的轨迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在银河系中的一粒微尘之上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">远旅：</div><div>多美丽啊……群星。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>看似无用的探索改变了一切。<br />正如遥远的星星改变了你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">1987 宇宙组曲</span></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "CO-20"}}